          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "The SHA-1 hash is used in the pass_audit tool to check password hashes against the HaveIBeenPwned API. It's part of the process where passwords are hashed with SHA-1 before being checked for breaches, which is problematic because SHA-1 is considered cryptographically broken and unsuitable for security purposes."
